  "item_short_desc": "<p>Just like a combat engineer, when there&rsquo;s a problem, you make it your mission to fix it. Proudly exhibit your industrial prowess and craftmanship with our Military Grade Workwear Bottle Cap T-Shirt. These iron-willed tees are great for tradesmen, industry workers, mechanics, carpenters, or anyone that turns a wrench.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133339",
  "description": "<p>Just like a combat engineer, when there&rsquo;s a problem, you make it your mission to fix it. Proudly exhibit your industrial prowess and craftmanship with our Military Grade Workwear Bottle Cap T-Shirt. These iron-willed tees are great for tradesmen, industry workers, mechanics, carpenters, or anyone that turns a wrench.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Reliable and Long-Lasting:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Go ahead and wear your graphic without a worry! The durable 60% Cotton / 40% Polyester blend easily withstands a hard day&rsquo;s work.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>For the Rough and Tough:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These rugged workwear style shirts feature reinforced seams at the collar and sleeves that enhance the shirt&rsquo;s durability, and with a tag-less neck label, you&rsquo;re free to move around without any itches or scratches.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Good Ol&rsquo; American Ingenuity:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These graphic t-shirts are inspired by the tenacity and creativity of the American spirit. The main design is across the back, with a shield and crossed wrenches on the left chest, and the American Flag on the right sleeve.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Fits Like a Glove:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These reliable t-shirts are standard fit, giving you the perfect amount of room and flexibility for any activity. Their length should go past the waist, providing you with additional coverage.</li>\n</ul>",
